      <p></p>
      <p>Taxation (Interest on Non-resident Trust Distributions) Act 1990</p>
      <p>No. 124 of 1990</p>
      <p>An Act to impose an interest charge in respect of distributions from certain trust estates</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to </i><i>28 December 1990</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
    </preface>
    <body>
      <section eId="sec-1">
        <num>1</num>
        <heading>Short title</heading>
        <content>
          <p>		This Act may be cited as the <i>Taxation (Interest on Non-resident Trust Distributions) Act 1990</i>.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-2">
        <num>2</num>
        <heading>Commencement</heading>
        <content>
          <p>This Act commences on the day on which it receives the Royal Assent.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-3">
        <num>3</num>
        <heading>Imposition of interest charge</heading>
        <content>
          <p>		Interest that is payable in accordance with <ref href="#sec-102A">section 102A</ref>AM of the <i>Income Tax Assessment A</i><i>ct 1936</i> is imposed by this Act.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
    </body>
